  'tama.help.basics': 'Your pet lives on in real time – even when you are offline. It has hunger and mood (four hearts each, like in 1996), needs sleep at night, makes droppings, gets dirty and can fall ill. The call LED on the device lights up whenever it needs you.',
  'tama.help.keys_t': 'The three softkeys',
  'tama.help.keys': 'Left “Scan” shows what your pet needs right now – every line leads straight to the fix. The middle key always does the most useful thing: warm, lights off, tuck in, medicine, fulfil a wish, open the drop, cuddle … Right “Menu” opens the eight stations. In menus the keys become Back · OK · Next, in games Left · Action · Right. Keyboard: ← Enter →, in menus also ↑ ↓ and Esc.',
